        "subject": "Introductory call & Business Expectations",
        "message": "=<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"/>\n  <style>\n    body {\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n      background-color: #f4f4f4;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n    .container {\n      max-width: 600px;\n      margin: 40px auto;\n      background-color: #ffffff;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n    }\n    .header {\n      background-color: #1a1a2e;\n      padding: 30px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n    .header h1 {\n      color: #ffffff;\n      font-size: 22px;\n      margin: 0;\n    }\n    .body {\n      padding: 30px;\n      color: #333333;\n      line-height: 1.8;\n    }\n    .body p {\n      margin: 0 0 16px;\n    }\n    .details-box {\n      background-color: #f0f4ff;\n      border-left: 4px solid #1a1a2e;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n      padding: 16px 20px;\n      margin: 20px 0;\n    }\n    .details-box p {\n      margin: 6px 0;\n      font-size: 15px;\n    }\n    .details-box span {\n      font-weight: bold;\n      color: #1a1a2e;\n    }\n    .meeting-box {\n      background-color: #fff8e1;\n      border-left: 4px solid #f0a500;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n      padding: 16px 20px;\n      margin: 20px 0;\n    }\n    .meeting-box p {\n      margin: 6px 0;\n      font-size: 15px;\n    }\n    .meeting-box span {\n      font-weight: bold;\n      color: #f0a500;\n    }\n    .btn {\n      display: inline-block;\n      margin: 20px 0;\n      padding: 12px 28px;\n      background-color: #1a1a2e;\n      color: #ffffff;\n      text-decoration: none;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      font-size: 15px;\n    }\n    .footer {\n      background-color: #f4f4f4;\n      text-align: center;\n      padding: 20px;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      color: #888888;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"container\">\n\n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <h1>Your Booking Confirmation</h1>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"body\">\n      <p>Dear <strong>{{ $('Step 6: Mapping out Data').item.json.Client_Name }}</strong>,</p>\n\n      <p>Thank you for trusting us with automating services in your current company. Please confirm that your details are as follows:</p>\n\n      <div class=\"details-box\">\n        <p><span>Name:</span> {{ $('Step 6: Mapping out Data').item.json.Client_Name }}</p>\n        <p><span>Phone:</span> {{ $('Step 6: Mapping out Data').item.json.Client_Phone }}</p>\n        <p><span>Email:</span> {{ $('Step 6: Mapping out Data').item.json.Client_Email }}</p>\n        <p><span>Plan:</span> {{ $('Step 6: Mapping out Data').item.json.Service_Plan }}</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <p>We have scheduled a call with one of our staff members who will be your point of contact:</p>\n\n      <div class=\"details-box\">\n        <p><span>Name:</span> {{ $('Step 6: Mapping out Data').item.json.Staff_Name }}</p>\n        <p><span>Email:</span> {{ $('Step 6: Mapping out Data').item.json.Staff_Email }}</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <p>Feel free to reach out to them in case of any questions.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"meeting-box\">\n        <p><span>📅 Meeting Date:</span> {{ $('Step 6: Mapping out Data').item.json.Meeting_Date }}</p>\n        <p><span>🕘 Time:</span> 9:30 AM</p>\n        <p><span>📌 Note:</span> Please be on the lookout on your calendar for a meeting invite.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <a href=\"{{ $json.htmlLink }}\" class=\"btn\">Join Meeting</a>\n\n      <p>I am looking forward to meeting you!</p>\n\n      <p>Warm regards,<br/>\n      <strong>{{ $('Step 6: Mapping out Data').item.json.Staff_Name }}</strong></p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n      <p>This is an automated message. Please do not reply directly to this email.</p>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "options": {}
